<title>CANADA: Toronto Eaton Centre gets C$200 mln refinancing.</title>
<headline>Toronto Eaton Centre gets C$200 mln refinancing.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cadillace Fairview Corp Ltd said on Monday that it, Toronto-Dominion Realty Ltd and the T. Eaton Co have arranged a refinancing of Toronto Eaton Centre.</p>
<p>The co-owners of the shopping complex in downtown Toronto said the proceeds of the refinancing were used to redeem outstanding series A, C, D, E, and G mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>&quot;The financing consists of a floating rate debt of approximately C$200 million,&quot; Cadillac Fairview said in a statement.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
